    title: "Redox OS 進行重大升級：新增 IO_uring 類 API、NUMA 支援與 QEMU 模擬器整合",
    summary: "Redox OS 於八月發布了最新的月度狀態更新，展示了多項重要的系統改進。其中最引人注目的是實作了一個類 IO_uring 的環形緩衝區通訊 API，這能顯著提升與 NVMe 儲存等支援驅動程式的 I/O 性能。此外，Redox OS 也加入了初步的 NUMA（非統一記憶體存取）支援。在虛擬化方面，QEMU 模擬器現已支援 Redox OS，但目前缺乏 KVM 級別的虛擬機器加速，運行速度預計會較慢。其他改進包括支援從 Linux 進行雙系統安裝，以及在 AArch64 架構上實現了初步的多核心 CPU 支援。整體系統層面也降低了 IPC 開銷約 5%，並縮減了核心二進位檔案大小。",
    tags: ["Redox OS", "IO_uring", "NUMA", "QEMU", "AArch64", "Rust"],
    title_en: "Redox OS Undergoes Major Upgrade: Adds IO_uring-like API, NUMA Support, and QEMU Emulator Integration",
    summary_en: "Redox OS released its latest monthly status update in August, showcasing several significant system improvements. Most notable is the implementation of a ring buffer communication API similar to IO_uring, which significantly boosts I/O performance with supported drivers like NVMe storage. Furthermore, Redox OS has added preliminary NUMA (Non-Uniform Memory Access) support. In virtualization, QEMU emulator now supports Redox OS, though it currently lacks KVM-level virtual machine acceleration, meaning performance is expected to be slower. Other improvements include support for dual-boot installations from Linux, and preliminary multi-core CPU support on the AArch64 architecture. Overall system efficiency has also seen a reduction in IPC overhead by approximately 5%, and the core binary size has been reduced.",
