    title: "ULTRALOQ發布Bolt Mission：利用超寬頻（UWB）技術實現更精準的無手動開鎖體驗",
    summary: "ULTRALOQ推出全新Bolt Mission智能門鎖，旨在解決傳統智慧門鎖在自動開鎖可靠性上的核心問題。與僅依賴GPS或藍牙追蹤位置的系統不同，Bolt Mission結合了藍牙低功耗（BLE）發現、超寬頻（UWB）技術，並加入內建雷達感應，能夠精確分析使用者接近門的距離和方向。這種意圖偵測邏輯在iPhone與門鎖之間運行，無需雲端連接或家中集線器，即使將iPhone放在口袋中，也能在接近門時自動開鎖，提供比傳統藍牙更可靠的空間感知能力。此外，ULTRALOQ還推出了Bolt Pro和Latch 5 Pro，這兩款產品均採用Aliro標準，支援透過Apple Wallet或Samsung Wallet進行「輕觸開鎖」（tap-to-unlock），這是一個跨平台開放標準，與Apple獨有的Home Key不同。所有新產品均通過Matter認證，可與Apple Home、Google Home、Amazon Alexa等主流智慧家居生態系統協作。建議使用者關注UWB技術在智慧門鎖領域的應用，以提升無手動開鎖的穩定性。",
    tags: ["ULTRALOQ", "Bolt Mission", "UWB", "Matter", "智慧門鎖", "Apple Home", "Aliro"],
    title_en: "ULTRALOQ Launches Bolt Mission: Achieving More Precise Keyless Unlock Experience Using Ultra-Wideband (UWB) Technology",
    summary_en: "ULTRALOQ has introduced the new Bolt Mission smart lock, designed to solve the core reliability issues of traditional smart locks regarding automatic unlocking. Unlike systems that rely solely on GPS or Bluetooth for location tracking, the Bolt Mission combines Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) discovery, Ultra-Wideband (UWB) technology, and built-in radar sensing. This allows it to accurately analyze the user's distance and direction relative to the door. This intent detection logic runs between the iPhone and the lock, eliminating the need for cloud connectivity or a home hub. It enables automatic unlocking when approaching the door, even if the iPhone is in a pocket, providing superior spatial awareness compared to traditional Bluetooth. Furthermore, ULTRALOQ also launched the Bolt Pro and Latch 5 Pro. Both of these products adopt the Aliro standard, supporting",
    tags_en: ["ULTRALOQ", "Bolt Mission", "UWB", "Matter", "Smart Lock", "Apple Home", "Aliro"],
